    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good overview. You mentioned \"friction\" in the context of roundabouts. Could you expand a bit more on what specific factors contribute to that friction in a roundabout versus a signalized intersection? I'm particularly interested in the intermittent nature of the interruptions in each system.",
